 <h3><u>Ek kafela laya tha mein</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><small><b><u><font size=5></font></u></b></small></p>
  <p><small><b><u><font size=5><small>Ek kafela laya tha mein</small></font></u></b></small></p>
  <small><b><u><font size=5><small> </small></font></u></b></small>
  <small><font size=5><small> </small><p><small>Sula hai kabr mai besheer ko husaini ghareeb,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Har ek shaheed ke lashe pe aaye hai rote huwe,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Labe husain se suye falak aayi sadaa</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Us kafele mein tha ali akber sa ek beta jawaan,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Abbas jesa bhayi tha,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Masum asgher be zubaan) x2 </small></p><small> </small><p><small>Kuch bibiya thi saath mein mehshar mein jinka naam tha</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Ye kafela kaise luta ye soch ke mai ro diya,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Pala tha jinko naaz se,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(karbobala mein kho diya),</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Un sab ke laashe samne the aur hoto par buka</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Karyal jawaan ki laash hatho par uthayi hai abhi,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Ek be zuban ki kabr bhi,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Maine banayi hai abhi) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Samaan mere katl ka karte hai ab ye ashkiya </small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>&nbsp;</small></p><small> </small><p><small>&nbsp;</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Pyase mere atfaal hai behta hai darya samne,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Ek be watan ko dasht mein,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Luta hai foje shaam ne) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Roti hai mere chah ne waalo ke laasho par kazaa</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Kismat meri laykar muje karbobala tak agayi,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Ab barte barte bat</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Zainab ki rida tak agayi) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Ho jawoonga mein katl to chinjayegi uski rida</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Kuch der mein kanjar laeen ka halk par chal jayenga,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Aur baad mere khaym-e</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Sadaat bhi jal jaayenga) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Ya yu koi pardes mein aa kar lootaye karbela</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Jab katl mein ho jawoonga shaame ghariba ayengi,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Saydaniyo ke kalb pe,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(taaza kayamat dhayengi) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>us waqt uthengi meri laashe buridaa se sadaa</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>&nbsp;</small></p><small> </small><p><small>&nbsp;</small></p><small> </small><p><small>&nbsp;</small></p><small> </small><p><small>lashe sabhi rehjayengi jalti zamin par bekafan,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>kaydi banengi mustufa </small></p><small> </small><p><small>(ki aal pabandhe rasan) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Raho mein rota jayenga bimar ye karke buka</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(Ek kafela laya tha mein) x3</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Reh jayengi bali sakina ki fugaa zindan mein,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>Kaydi rahengi saal bhar,</small></p><small> </small><p><small>(saydaniya zindan mein) x2</small></p><small> </small><p><small>sajaad mera kayd se jayenga ye kehte huwa.</small></p></font></small>
